<%@ page import="pe.isaacsportgrass.Security" %>
<% if(!Security.allowed(request,"ADMIN")){response.sendRedirect("login.jsp");return;} %>
<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Panel administrativo | ISAAC SPORT GRASS</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/estilos.css"><script defer src="js/funciones.js"></script></head><body data-page="admin" class="admin-page">
<div class="admin-layout"><aside class="admin-sidebar" id="admin-sidebar"><div class="admin-sidebar-brand"><a class="brand brand-light" href="index.jsp"><span class="brand-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2 22 8v8l-10 6L2 16V8Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m2 8 10 6 10-6M12 14v8" stroke="currentColor" fill="none"/></svg></span>ISAAC SPORT GRASS<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><small>PANEL DE ADMINISTRACIÓN</small></div><div class="sidebar-group-label">GENERAL</div><nav class="sidebar-nav" aria-label="Administración"><button class="sidebar-link active" data-admin-section="dashboard"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#layout-dashboard"/></svg> Vista general</button><button class="sidebar-link" data-admin-section="canchas"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#grid"/></svg> Mis canchas</button><button class="sidebar-link" data-admin-section="reservas"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#calendar"/></svg> Reservas <span class="side-count" id="sidebar-bookings">0</span></button><button class="sidebar-link" data-admin-section="productos"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#shopping-bag"/></svg> Tienda y productos</button><button class="sidebar-link" data-admin-section="yape" id="menu-configurar-yape"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#credit-card"/></svg> Configurar Yape</button></nav><div class="sidebar-separator"></div><div class="sidebar-group-label">ACCESOS</div><nav class="sidebar-nav"><a class="sidebar-link" href="index.jsp"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#home"/></svg> Ver sitio web</a><button class="sidebar-link" id="logout-admin"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#logout"/></svg> Cerrar sesión</button></nav><div class="sidebar-bottom"><span class="side-status"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> Sistema conectado a MySQL</span><div class="sidebar-admin-avatar">A</div><div><strong>Administrador</strong><small>admin@isaacsportgrass.pe</small></div></div></aside>
<div class="admin-main"><header class="admin-topbar"><div><button id="admin-menu-btn" class="mobile-menu-btn admin-menu-btn" aria-label="Mostrar menú"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#menu"/></svg></button><span class="breadcrumb">Administración <svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#chevron-right"/></svg> <strong id="admin-breadcrumb">Vista general</strong></span></div><div class="admin-top-actions"><span class="today-label" id="admin-today"></span><span class="admin-badge"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#shield"/></svg> Administrador</span><span class="top-avatar">A</span></div></header>
<main class="admin-content"><section class="admin-section" id="admin-section-dashboard"><div class="admin-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow text-green">PANEL DE CONTROL</span><h1>El juego está <em>en marcha.</em></h1><p>Un vistazo general a la actividad de ISAAC SPORT GRASS.</p></div><button class="btn btn-dark" data-admin-section="canchas"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#plus"/></svg> Gestionar canchas</button></div><div class="admin-stats" id="admin-stats"></div><div class="admin-dashboard-grid"><div class="admin-panel chart-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Actividad de reservas</h3><p>Resumen ilustrativo de los últimos 7 días</p></div><span class="tiny-label">RESUMEN</span></div><div class="chart-area"><div class="chart-bars" id="admin-chart"></div><div class="chart-labels"><span>Lun</span><span>Mar</span><span>Mié</span><span>Jue</span><span>Vie</span><span>Sáb</span><span>Dom</span></div></div></div><div class="admin-panel quick-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Accesos rápidos</h3><p>Gestiona tu espacio desde aquí</p></div></div><button data-admin-section="canchas"><span class="quick-icon"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#grid"/></svg></span><span><strong>Administrar canchas</strong><small>Revisa la disponibilidad</small></span><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#arrow-up-right"/></svg></button><button data-admin-section="reservas"><span class="quick-icon"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#calendar"/></svg></span><span><strong>Ver reservaciones</strong><small>Confirma o cancela reservas</small></span><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#arrow-up-right"/></svg></button><button data-admin-section="productos"><span class="quick-icon"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#package"/></svg></span><span><strong>Gestionar inventario</strong><small>Actualiza el stock</small></span><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#arrow-up-right"/></svg></button></div></div><div class="admin-panel dashboard-recent"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Últimas reservas</h3><p>Solicitudes generadas desde la página de usuarios</p></div><button class="text-link" data-admin-section="reservas">Ver todas <svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#arrow-right"/></svg></button></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>CANCHA</th><th>CLIENTE</th><th>FECHA</th><th>IMPORTE</th><th>ESTADO</th></tr></thead><tbody id="recent-reservations"></tbody></table></div></div></section>
<section class="admin-section" id="admin-section-canchas" hidden><div class="admin-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow text-green">INSTALACIONES DEPORTIVAS</span><h1>Mis canchas <em>.</em></h1><p>Administra tus espacios y controla su disponibilidad.</p></div><button class="btn btn-lime" id="add-court-btn"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#plus"/></svg> Nueva cancha</button></div><div class="admin-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Listado de canchas</h3><p id="admin-court-label">Canchas registradas</p></div><span class="tiny-label">GESTIÓN</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>CANCHA</th><th>DEPORTE</th><th>DISTRITO</th><th>PRECIO/H</th><th>ESTADO</th><th>ACCIÓN</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admin-courts-table"></tbody></table></div></div><p class="demo-hint"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#info"/></svg> Al desactivar una cancha, deja de mostrarse en el listado público de reservas.</p></section>
<section class="admin-section" id="admin-section-reservas" hidden><div class="admin-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow text-green">CONTROL DE PARTIDOS</span><h1>Reservaciones <em>.</em></h1><p>Gestiona las solicitudes y estados de cada reserva.</p></div><select class="admin-select" id="admin-booking-filter" aria-label="Filtrar reservas"><option value="Todas">Todas las reservas</option><option value="Pendiente">Pendientes</option><option value="Confirmada">Confirmadas</option><option value="Cancelada">Canceladas</option></select></div><div class="admin-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Registro de reservas</h3><p>Información almacenada en MySQL</p></div><span class="tiny-label">BASE DE DATOS</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>CANCHA</th><th>CLIENTE</th><th>FECHA / HORA</th><th>IMPORTE</th><th>ESTADO</th><th>GESTIONAR</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admin-reservations-table"></tbody></table></div></div></section>
<section class="admin-section" id="admin-section-yape" hidden><div class="admin-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow text-green">MÉTODO DE PAGO PARA TODAS LAS CANCHAS</span><h1>Configurar <em>Yape.</em></h1><p>Guarda el número receptor y el QR real del propietario. Los clientes verán estos datos al separar cualquier cancha con el 50%.</p></div></div><div id="isg-yape-settings-slot"></div></section>
<section class="admin-section" id="admin-section-productos" hidden><div class="admin-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow text-green">ISAAC SPORT GRASS STORE</span><h1>Inventario deportivo <em>.</em></h1><p>Controla la disponibilidad de los artículos de la tienda.</p></div><span class="admin-inventory-count" id="inventory-total">0 artículos</span></div><div class="admin-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Productos de la tienda</h3><p>Usa los botones + y − para modificar las unidades.</p></div><span class="tiny-label">INVENTARIO</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>PRODUCTO</th><th>CATEGORÍA</th><th>PRECIO</th><th>DISPONIBILIDAD</th><th>STOCK</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admin-products-table"></tbody></table></div></div><p class="demo-hint"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#info"/></svg> Los cambios de stock se guardan en MySQL y aparecen en la tienda.</p></section>
</main></div></div>
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="new-court-modal" hidden><div class="modal-dialog modal-narrow" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="new-court-title"><button class="modal-close" data-close-modal aria-label="Cerrar"><svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#x"/></svg></button><div class="modal-pad"><span class="eyebrow text-green">NUEVO ESPACIO DEPORTIVO</span><h2 id="new-court-title">Agregar una cancha</h2><p class="modal-description">Completa la información para incluirla en el catálogo.</p><form class="form-stack" id="new-court-form"><div class="form-group"><label for="new-court-name">Nombre de la cancha</label><input class="standard-input" id="new-court-name" required maxlength="60" placeholder="Ej. Complejo Las Palmas"></div><div class="form-group"><label for="new-court-sport">Deporte</label><select class="standard-input" id="new-court-sport" required><option>Fútbol</option><option>Tenis</option><option>Básquet</option><option>Vóley</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label for="new-court-district">Distrito</label><select class="standard-input" id="new-court-district" required><option>Santa Anita</option><option>La Molina</option><option>Ate</option><option>San Borja</option><option>Surco</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label for="new-court-price">Precio por hora (S/)</label><input class="standard-input" id="new-court-price" type="number" min="1" max="2000" step="1" required placeholder="80"></div><button class="btn btn-lime btn-full btn-lg" type="submit">Guardar cancha <svg class="ico"><use href="img/icons.svg#check"/></svg></button></form></div></div></div>
<div class="toast-container" id="toasts" aria-live="polite"></div>
<script defer src="js/pagos.js"></script></body></html>
